			<description>The inquisitor adds her Wisdom modifier on Knowledge skill checks in addition to her Intelligence modifier, when making skill checks to identify the abilities and weaknesses of creatures.</description>
			<type>INQUISITORCLASSFEATURES.SPECIALQUALITY.EXTRAORDINARY</type>
